          "support_widening",
          "production_platform_claim",
          "gpp_status_guard_flip",
          "submanifest_bc10_flip"
        ]
      },
      "description": "Negative authority statement. All 9 forbidden actions enumerated explicitly so a reviewer can verify by name what this artifact CANNOT permit. Two more entries than BC-1 6a (added billable_provider_call_now + submanifest_bc10_flip for bc10 explicitness)."
    },
